WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
C. difficile keeps coming back. Can an antibody against its toxin stop that?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
MODIFY I and II enrolled 2655 adults adults being treated for C. difficile.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
MODIFY I recurrence: 17% with bezlotoxumab versus 28% with placebo.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
MODIFY II: 16% versus 26%. The same result twice.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Sustained cure: 64% versus 54%.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Number needed to treat: 10 overall, 6 in older patients or after a previous episode.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Bezlotoxumab lowered recurrence. N Engl J Med, 2017. Scroll for the full breakdown.
